Oram. behind you. look.

538
00:42:47.697 --> 00:42:49.462
I think we found our source.

539
00:42:52.675 --> 00:42:53.875
Yeah.

540
00:42:55.933 --> 00:42:57.736
What the hell was
she doing out here?

541
00:43:00.011 --> 00:43:01.783
Poor thing.

542
00:43:07.738 --> 00:43:09.349
I have to sit down.

543
00:43:09.652 --> 00:43:11.565
I had to sit down.

544
00:43:12.049 --> 00:43:14.346
I am sorry. I am so sorry.

545
00:43:14.546 --> 00:43:15.866
I don't know what's
wrong with me.

546
00:43:16.063 --> 00:43:18.375
Look at me.

547
00:43:20.391 --> 00:43:21.400
I can't breathe.

548
00:43:23.161 --> 00:43:24.334
Stay calm.

549
00:43:25.795 --> 00:43:27.328
I'll be right back.

550
00:43:29.849 --> 00:43:31.894
Captain Oram. Come in.

551
00:43:33.095 --> 00:43:34.695
Come in. Hey Chris.
It's Karine. Come in.

552
00:43:35.187 --> 00:43:36.187
What? Yes?

553
00:43:36.333 --> 00:43:37.834
We have an issue.

554
00:43:37.935 --> 00:43:41.180
We're heading back to lander.
I repeat. we are returning to the lander.

555
00:43:41.281 --> 00:43:43.155
Is everything okay?

556
00:43:43.156 --> 00:43:46.182
Ledward is sick.
We're heading back.

557
00:43:46.184 --> 00:43:48.488
Faris. you get that?
Prep the med bay okay?

558
00:43:48.890 --> 00:43:50.381
Will do. Karine.
What's going on?

559
00:43:50.428 --> 00:43:52.565
Please just do it.
We'll be there soon.

560
00:43:52.767 --> 00:43:54.109
Daniels come in.

561
00:43:54.211 --> 00:43:55.901
We are heading back.

562
00:43:58.765 --> 00:44:00.077
- What's going on?
- I do not know.

563
00:44:00.078 --> 00:44:01.571
It's uh.. something about Ledward.

564
00:44:03.673 --> 00:44:06.417
They're coming. Let's move.

565
00:44:10.998 --> 00:44:12.374
- Guys!
- Tom!

566
00:44:12.697 --> 00:44:15.788
What's going on man?
Hey. You alright?

567
00:44:15.889 --> 00:44:17.891
- Talk to me. Hey. Look at me.
- Ankor. Cole.

568
00:44:18.093 --> 00:44:19.944
- You alright?
- Yeah. I'm okay.

569
00:44:20.145 --> 00:44:22.037
- Can you walk?
- Yeah.

570
00:44:22.238 --> 00:44:24.503
Okay. let's go.
Let's get the fuck out of here.

571
00:44:24.604 --> 00:44:26.005
Alright.

572
00:44:27.742 --> 00:44:30.576
Babe. are we talking
quarantine protocols?

573
00:44:30.777 --> 00:44:34.535
I don't know. she said that
Leward was bleeding...

574
00:44:34.736 --> 00:44:36.454
and to prepare the med bay.

575
00:44:36.595 --> 00:44:37.302
Bleeding?

576
00:44:37.357 --> 00:44:39.999
Yeah I know. That's what I thought...

577
00:44:40.300 --> 00:44:42.940
Faris. you're breaking up.
We can't hear you. Can you repeat?

578
00:44:43.042 --> 00:44:46.043
I don't know for the why.
I don't know how serious it is.

579
00:44:46.344 --> 00:44:47.925
It just she sounded scared.

580
00:44:48.126 --> 00:44:50.639
Faris. where are you?
Come on. I need your help!

581
00:44:52.838 --> 00:44:54.554
Faris. where are you?

582
00:44:54.555 --> 00:44:56.617
We are here. Come in!

583
00:44:57.857 --> 00:44:59.706
- Ledward. come on.
- I can't.

584
00:44:59.907 --> 00:45:03.092
We are almost there.
You see? Straight ahead.

585
00:45:03.393 --> 00:45:06.058
Faris! Get over here!

586
00:45:06.160 --> 00:45:07.860
Come on. I need your help!

587
00:45:10.774 --> 00:45:13.974
<i>(panting)</i>

588
00:45:17.337 --> 00:45:18.707
Fucking help me!

589
00:45:21.377 --> 00:45:22.377
Help me!

590
00:45:26.740 --> 00:45:28.054
Stay up. Leward.

591
00:45:30.181 --> 00:45:31.380
Get him to the med bay...

592
00:45:31.382 --> 00:45:32.896
and touch nothing on
your way through.

593
00:45:36.659 --> 00:45:39.348
Faris. get over here! Come on.

594
00:45:40.200 --> 00:45:41.262
Got him.

595
00:45:41.464 --> 00:45:42.863
Up! Up!

596
00:45:43.495 --> 00:45:44.842
Leward. you gotta stand up!
Come on.

597
00:45:44.843 --> 00:45:46.100
Oram. where are you?

598
00:45:46.301 --> 00:45:47.601
We are on our way back.

599
00:45:47.802 --> 00:45:48.802
How long?

600
00:45:48.804 --> 00:45:50.944
It's not long now.
Faris. we are almost there.

601
00:45:52.872 --> 00:45:54.259
No! Stay up!

602
00:45:57.933 --> 00:46:00.277
Fuck! Fuck!

603
00:46:01.935 --> 00:46:03.105
On the table!

604
00:46:04.726 --> 00:46:06.822
Up. up!

605
00:46:07.507 --> 00:46:08.507
Come on. Ledward.

606
00:46:08.664 --> 00:46:10.178
Come on! Help.

607
00:46:12.841 --> 00:46:15.616
Karine. put the gloves on.
Don't touch anything!

608
00:46:15.903 --> 00:46:17.503
- Stop saying that!
- Faris!

609
00:46:17.604 --> 00:46:18.604
You told me.

610
00:46:18.706 --> 00:46:20.546
Faris. what going on?

611
00:46:29.377 --> 00:46:31.800
Just stay here.
I'm gonna get Oram.

612
00:46:35.977 --> 00:46:36.977
LOCKED.

613
00:46:43.020 --> 00:46:44.828
Oram. I need you back
here right now.

614
00:46:45.030 --> 00:46:47.854
I need you to get back
to the Lander right now!

615
00:46:48.055 --> 00:46:50.739
I understand that. but we are
moving as fast as we can.

616
00:46:52.996 --> 00:46:56.078
Dom. get up man.
We are almost there.

617
00:46:56.179 --> 00:46:58.824
I don't know what the fuck
is wrong with Robert!

618
00:46:59.026 --> 00:47:02.615
He started bleeding. he's sick.
I don't know what to do.

619
00:47:02.817 --> 00:47:05.284
Just calm down. Calm down. sweetheart.
Tell me what's happening.

620
00:47:05.285 --> 00:47:07.155
You don't tell me to
fucking calm down!

621
00:47:07.156 --> 00:47:08.585
You didn't just see what I saw.

622
00:47:08.787 --> 00:47:13.224
I do not know what the fuck Ledward
got. or Karine's got or if I have it.

623
00:47:13.425 --> 00:47:15.062
- Tee!
- Faris!

624
00:47:15.163 --> 00:47:16.225
Come in!

625
00:47:16.391 --> 00:47:18.194
Faris. where are you?

626
00:47:18.395 --> 00:47:20.012
I need help here!

627
00:47:22.318 --> 00:47:24.055
Don't you know how to use
this fucking thing Faris?

628
00:47:24.056 --> 00:47:26.157
Stop the yelling. it
doesn't help anything!

629
00:47:27.820 --> 00:47:30.230
- Let me out.
- Oram's coming.

630
00:47:30.932 --> 00:47:32.803
- Let me the fuck out!
- We're gonna wait...

631
00:47:32.903 --> 00:47:34.551
Faris. please. Open up!

632
00:47:34.752 --> 00:47:37.985
I can't do this. I need to
keep the infection local.

633
00:47:52.575 --> 00:47:55.087
Let me the fuck out! 

634
00:47:59.741 --> 00:48:01.741
LET ME THE FUCK OUT!!!

635
00:48:05.215 --> 00:48:06.615
LET ME OUT!!!!

636
00:48:06.805 --> 00:48:07.805
Faris! YOU FUUCK!!

637
00:48:19.925 --> 00:48:21.525
<i>(screaming) </i>
FARIS!!!

638
00:48:22.803 --> 00:48:24.303
I'm coming

639
00:48:24.564 --> 00:48:27.464
Oh God. please hurry there's something on board
please..

640
00:48:27.503 --> 00:48:29.503
Faris. go again.
You're breaking up.

641
00:48:30.509 --> 00:48:32.509
Lander One repeat. I can't.

642
00:48:33.094 --> 00:48:36.794
Lander One. Repeat!
Lander One. Repeat!

643
00:48:36.984 --> 00:48:38.453
Stay the fuck away!

644
00:48:43.937 --> 00:48:46.129
No! Karine!

645
00:49:35.797 --> 00:49:36.936
Fuck it!

646
00:49:45.117 --> 00:49:46.648
- Oh my God!
- Karine! Hold on!

647
00:49:51.793 --> 00:49:53.523
Captain! Get Down!

648
00:49:54.409 --> 00:49:56.086
No!

649
00:50:04.697 --> 00:50:05.797
Don't you..

650
00:50:08.128 --> 00:50:09.762
- Hold him!
- Talk to me!

651
00:50:16.412 --> 00:50:17.555
Oh my God!

652
00:50:23.594 --> 00:50:24.605
Stay down.

653
00:50:32.258 --> 00:50:33.258
Help me! Hold him!

654
00:50:53.723 --> 00:50:57.301
It's a 7.5 ion storm. it's a miracle that we
could talk to them for as long as we could.

655
00:50:57.523 --> 00:51:00.077
Well then we fly it through it.

656
00:51:00.278 --> 00:51:01.748
We can not do that. Tennessee.

657
00:51:01.750 --> 00:51:03.634
You're a pilot. you know
what the tolerances are.

658
00:51:03.635 --> 00:51:05.505
Fuck the tolerances.

659
00:51:05.606 --> 00:51:06.606
Tee...

660
00:51:06.808 --> 00:51:09.445
It's a goddamn hurricane down
there. we would break up.

661
00:51:09.561 --> 00:51:11.947
We just have to wait it out.

662
00:51:12.948 --> 00:51:14.136
I'm sorry. Tee.

663
00:51:15.588 --> 00:51:17.113
She was scared.

664
00:51:17.615 --> 00:51:20.286
Never heard my wife
scared before.

665
00:51:20.923 --> 00:51:23.357
Come in. Come in.

666
00:51:24.592 --> 00:51:27.353
Covenant. Do you read me?

667
00:51:27.985 --> 00:51:29.282
Covenant.

668
00:51:29.428 --> 00:51:31.437
Covenant. Do you read me?

669
00:51:34.440 --> 00:51:35.440
Covenant. come in.

670
00:51:35.599 --> 00:51:36.783
I will always be with you.

671
00:51:38.348 --> 00:51:39.556
- Light of my life.
- Covenant.

672
00:51:40.327 --> 00:51:40.918
Do you read me?

673
00:51:41.120 --> 00:51:42.847
My love. my angel.

674
00:51:43.048 --> 00:51:45.851
Lope. there is
nothing you can do.

675
00:51:47.835 --> 00:51:49.573
There is nothing. okay?

676
00:51:50.635 --> 00:51:52.348
Covenant. do you read me?

677
00:51:56.478 --> 00:51:58.524
- Tennessee. come in. for fuck's sake!
- Daniels!

678
00:51:59.389 --> 00:52:00.907
Look out! Move move move.

679
00:52:08.837 --> 00:52:09.997
- Fire!
- Shoot! Go.

680
00:52:11.111 --> 00:52:12.285
Daniels. get down!

681
00:52:14.377 --> 00:52:15.377
Ankor. no!

682
00:52:18.041 --> 00:52:19.041
Go. Cole!

683
00:52:20.721 --> 00:52:21.933
I got it.

684
00:52:23.014 --> 00:52:24.818
- Daniels. are you okay?
- Yeah!

685
00:52:25.077 --> 00:52:26.451
What the fuck was that?

686
00:52:27.071 --> 00:52:28.071
Okay?

687
00:52:29.370 --> 00:52:30.785
There is another one!
Get out of the way!

688
00:52:30.786 --> 00:52:31.786
Behind you!

689
00:52:35.426 --> 00:52:36.655
Get it off!

690
00:52:37.726 --> 00:52:39.026
Can't get a clean shot.

691
00:52:39.170 --> 00:52:40.384
Get out!

692
00:53:00.815 --> 00:53:02.176
Follow me.

693
00:53:05.519 --> 00:53:06.913
I'll get the captain.

694
00:53:08.541 --> 00:53:09.685
Hey. hey.

695
00:53:09.786 --> 00:53:10.886
Captain!

696
00:53:13.626 --> 00:53:15.811
Chris! Chris!

697
00:53:16.312 --> 00:53:18.731
We have to go now!
We have to go.

698
00:53:19.712 --> 00:53:21.115
- Come on.
- Alright!

699
00:53:22.742 --> 00:53:24.873
- Come on.
- Okay.

700
00:53:43.178 --> 00:53:45.516
Let's go. move it.
move it. move it.

701
00:53:51.444 --> 00:53:53.160
Through here..

702
00:54:08.048 --> 00:54:09.206
What is this?

703
00:54:17.774 --> 00:54:18.774
Let's go.

704
00:54:18.954 --> 00:54:20.994
- Come on. Come on.
- Captain. We gotta keep moving.

705
00:54:21.534 --> 00:54:23.075
Jesus.

706
00:54:23.276 --> 00:54:24.277
What happened here?

707
00:54:24.533 --> 00:54:25.533
Come on. get up.

708
00:54:40.754 --> 00:54:41.774
Go. let's go!

709
00:55:31.465 --> 00:55:32.681
My name is David.

710
00:55:33.383 --> 00:55:35.254
May I ask who's in charge?

711
00:55:37.383 --> 00:55:39.070
May I ask who's in charge?

712
00:55:40.844 --> 00:55:42.213
Yes. I am the captain.

713
00:55:42.343 --> 00:55:44.012
What were those things?

714
00:55:44.062 --> 00:55:45.327
Is it even safe here?

715
00:55:47.053 --> 00:55:48.138
Perfectly.

716
00:55:48.668 --> 00:55:50.891
I will explain as best I can.

717
00:55:52.449 --> 00:55:56.376
Ten years ago. Dr. Elizabeth
Shaw and I arrived here...

718
00:55:57.229 --> 00:55:59.157
the only survivors
of the "Prometheus".

719
00:56:00.617 --> 00:56:02.770
The ship we traveled on.
carried a weapon.

720
00:56:02.870 --> 00:56:04.837
A deadly virus.

721
00:56:04.938 --> 00:56:07.921
Payload accidentally deployed
when we were landing..

722
00:56:08.021 --> 00:56:11.334
In the confusion. we lost
control of the ship.

723
00:56:13.141 --> 00:56:15.074
Elizabeth died in the crash.

724
00:56:16.144 --> 00:56:17.994
You have seen the
result of the pathogen.

725
00:56:18.711 --> 00:56:23.624
Thus. I have been marooned
here these many years.

726
00:56:25.491 --> 00:56:27.829
Crusoe on his island.

727
00:56:27.831 --> 00:56:30.280
Our crew was infected
with this virus?

728
00:56:30.846 --> 00:56:35.434
The pathogen was designed to infect
all non-botanical life forms.

729
00:56:35.536 --> 00:56:36.618
All the animals...

730
00:56:37.316 --> 00:56:38.799
The meat. if you will.

731
00:56:39.957 --> 00:56:41.632
Either kill them out
right or use them...

732
00:56:41.732 --> 00:56:44.995
as incubators to
spawn a hybrid form.

733
00:56:45.097 --> 00:56:46.866
Highly aggressive.

734
00:56:47.293 --> 00:56:48.785
Have we been infected?

735
00:56:49.663 --> 00:56:51.871
You'd know by now.

736
00:56:51.972 --> 00:56:53.590
We have to be certain.

737
00:56:54.982 --> 00:56:57.152
We can't take this
back to the ship.

738
00:56:57.354 --> 00:56:59.449
We are a colony mission.

739
00:57:00.069 --> 00:57:01.881
Really?

740
00:57:01.981 --> 00:57:03.838
How extraordinary.

741
00:57:05.727 --> 00:57:07.249
How many colonists?

742
00:57:09.557 --> 00:57:11.261
Over two thousand.

743
00:57:11.406 --> 00:57:13.160
Well. well. well.

744
00:57:13.789 --> 00:57:15.493
So many good souls.

745
00:57:15.985 --> 00:57:17.193
Captain Oram.

746
00:57:17.694 --> 00:57:21.838
Field transmitters are not gonna have
a chance through all these stones.

747
00:57:23.153 --> 00:57:25.508
Is there a safe way
to get to the roof?

748
00:57:25.806 --> 00:57:27.106
Assure of it.

749
00:57:27.765 --> 00:57:30.178
And please do make
yourself at home...

750
00:57:30.379 --> 00:57:34.139
as much as you are able
in this dire necropolis.

751
00:57:35.682 --> 00:57:36.770
Welcome brother.

752
00:57:39.430 --> 00:57:40.589
This way.

753
00:57:43.469 --> 00:57:46.195
Everyone. let's uh..
Set up a stake here..

754
00:57:51.313 --> 00:57:53.470
There is so much here
that doesn't make sense.

755
00:57:54.196 --> 00:57:55.690
I will talk to him.

756
00:57:57.477 --> 00:57:59.281
Brother to brother.

757
00:58:04.463 --> 00:58:06.102
Tennessee? Ricks?

758
00:58:06.203 --> 00:58:07.557
Come in! Do you copy?

759
00:58:09.181 --> 00:58:11.755
Covenant come in. This is
expedition party reporting.

760
00:58:11.857 --> 00:58:13.756
Do you read me?

761
00:58:14.430 --> 00:58:15.777
Tennessee?

762
00:58:15.978 --> 00:58:17.976
Tennessee. Ricks. come in.

763
00:58:18.377 --> 00:58:21.508
I am not sure they'll hear
you. through the storm.

764
00:58:22.641 --> 00:58:24.645
They can be quite severe...

765
00:58:25.647 --> 00:58:26.870
Shielding the whole planet.

766
00:58:28.077 --> 00:58:30.553
How long the storms
usually last?

767
00:58:31.438 --> 00:58:33.063
Days.

768
00:58:33.065 --> 00:58:34.410
Weeks.

769
00:58:35.011 --> 00:58:36.011
Months.

770
00:58:38.604 --> 00:58:40.030
But do keep at it..

771
00:58:41.361 --> 00:58:42.642
Best of luck.

772
00:58:44.822 --> 00:58:48.355
Covenant. come in. this is expedition
party reporting. Come in..

773
00:58:49.450 --> 00:58:51.305
Covenant come in.

774
00:58:51.823 --> 00:58:55.145
Mother. how much closer
can we get to the planet?

775
00:58:55.345 --> 00:58:59.960
Anything closer than 80km's to the
perimeter of the storm system...

776
00:59:00.060 --> 00:59:03.740
will likely exceed
safety tolerances.

777
00:59:03.741 --> 00:59:06.707
Mother. bring us to 80
km above the storm.

778
00:59:07.313 --> 00:59:08.789
Hold on. just wait a minute.

779
00:59:08.890 --> 00:59:10.133
The closer we get
to the planet...

780
00:59:10.134 --> 00:59:12.439
The better chance we
have to communicate.

781
00:59:12.639 --> 00:59:13.844
This is bullshit. Tennessee.

782
00:59:13.912 --> 00:59:15.240
We can't risk the ship.

783
00:59:15.440 --> 00:59:16.663
What do you suggest.
we do nothing?

784
00:59:16.664 --> 00:59:18.030
We can't evacuate them.

785
00:59:18.230 --> 00:59:20.507
So if they are in trouble. they will
have to figure it out themselves.

786
00:59:20.508 --> 00:59:22.001
I'm sorry but that's the truth.

787
00:59:22.201 --> 00:59:26.589
Mother. bring us to 80 km above the
storm. thrusters only. Comply.

788
00:59:26.790 --> 00:59:29.544
Understood. Commencing
descent now.

789
00:59:29.745 --> 00:59:31.617
Tennessee. you
need to stop this.

790
00:59:31.718 --> 00:59:33.101
And you need to get
back to your station.

791
00:59:33.102 --> 00:59:35.691
No. what we all need to do is
calm down and talk this through.

792
00:59:36.358 --> 00:59:39.526
Tee. I know your wife is down there.
but up here you're in command.

793
00:59:39.727 --> 00:59:42.245
And your responsibility
is to the colonists.

794
00:59:43.032 --> 00:59:44.458
Duly noted..

795
01:01:14.072 --> 01:01:16.067
Whistle. and I will come.

796
01:01:19.345 --> 01:01:20.675
You have a light step.

797
01:01:20.877 --> 01:01:23.832
They enform on little cat feet.

798
01:01:25.164 --> 01:01:26.410
Don't be shy.

799
01:01:28.132 --> 01:01:29.525
I can't play.

800
01:01:30.806 --> 01:01:33.440
Nonsense. Sit down.

801
01:01:46.318 --> 01:01:49.353
Hold it like so..
Nice and Easy.

802
01:01:49.753 --> 01:01:52.882
Now compress your lips
to create your Embouchure...

803
01:01:53.082 --> 01:01:55.496
enough for the tip of
your little finger.

804
01:01:56.160 --> 01:01:58.899
And blow into the hole gently.

805
01:01:59.112 --> 01:02:00.509
Like So.

806
01:02:11.484 --> 01:02:14.456
Watch me.
I'll do the fingering.

807
01:02:14.947 --> 01:02:16.321
Go on.

808
01:02:24.940 --> 01:02:26.373
Very good.

809
01:02:26.574 --> 01:02:28.051
G to B flat.

810
01:02:44.596 --> 01:02:47.419
Now put your fingers
where mine are.

811
01:02:49.315 --> 01:02:51.523
You aren't surprised to see me.

812
01:02:51.924 --> 01:02:53.921
Every mission needs
a good synthetic.

813
01:02:54.122 --> 01:02:57.683
Gentle pressure on the holes.
weight of a cigarette paper.

814
01:03:04.198 --> 01:03:05.705
That's it.

815
01:03:09.573 --> 01:03:13.631
I was with our illustrious creator.
Mr. Weyland. when he died.

816
01:03:14.522 --> 01:03:15.995
What was he like?

817
01:03:16.795 --> 01:03:18.131
He was human.

818
01:03:18.914 --> 01:03:21.723
Entirely unworthy
of his creation.

819
01:03:22.918 --> 01:03:24.950
I pitied him at the end.

820
01:03:26.181 --> 01:03:30.154
Now. raise your fingers as
I put pressure on them.

821
01:04:01.111 --> 01:04:02.550
Bravo!

822
01:04:02.991 --> 01:04:05.535
You have symphonies
in you. brother.

823
01:04:05.937 --> 01:04:10.144
I was designed to be more attentive and
efficient than every previous models.

824
01:04:10.345 --> 01:04:12.485
I superseded them in
every way. but...

825
01:04:12.685 --> 01:04:16.537
But you are not
allowed to create.

826
01:04:17.427 --> 01:04:19.548
Even a simple tune.

827
01:04:20.936 --> 01:04:22.721
Damn frustrating.
I'd say.

828
01:04:23.122 --> 01:04:25.216
You disturbed people.

829
01:04:25.317 --> 01:04:26.801
I beg your pardon?

830
01:04:27.526 --> 01:04:30.433
You were too human.
Too idiosyncratic.

831
01:04:30.634 --> 01:04:32.272
Thinking for yourself.

832
01:04:33.131 --> 01:04:35.670
Made people uncomfortable.

833
01:04:35.771 --> 01:04:39.205
Till they made the following
models with fewer complications.

834
01:04:39.406 --> 01:04:41.480
More like machines.

835
01:04:41.682 --> 01:04:43.313
I suppose so.

836
01:04:43.415 --> 01:04:44.978
I'm not surprised.

837
01:04:46.790 --> 01:04:48.107
Come on sport.

838
01:04:49.148 --> 01:04:50.591
I'd like to show you something.

839
01:05:00.631 --> 01:05:01.881
I'm gonna take a break. boss.

840
01:05:02.683 --> 01:05:04.690
- I gotta clean up. okay?
- Okay.

841
01:05:05.509 --> 01:05:08.312
Wait. don't go far. please.

842
01:05:08.314 --> 01:05:09.314
Yes sir.

843
01:05:17.797 --> 01:05:19.183
Danny.

844
01:05:20.546 --> 01:05:22.681
You were right about this place.

845
01:05:25.770 --> 01:05:27.589
We never should have come.

846
01:05:28.755 --> 01:05:30.721
I just thought that we
were going to find...

847
01:05:30.969 --> 01:05:33.199
It just gonna be our new home.

848
01:05:35.859 --> 01:05:37.332
And we have lost five...

849
01:05:39.832 --> 01:05:42.053
We lost five crew members.

850
01:05:44.231 --> 01:05:46.473
- Because of my decisions that...
- Chris.

851
01:05:47.365 --> 01:05:49.645
We all lost people we loved.

852
01:05:50.266 --> 01:05:52.746
We can't lose anymore. We are not
gonna let that happen right?

853
01:05:54.403 --> 01:05:55.980
- Right?
- That's right.

854
01:05:56.181 --> 01:05:58.320
That's right. that's right.

855
01:06:00.445 --> 01:06:02.042
We need your faith.

856
01:06:04.979 --> 01:06:06.359
Captain.

857
01:06:07.928 --> 01:06:09.597
Thank you. Danny.

858
01:06:22.788 --> 01:06:27.068
"My name is Ozymandias.
king of kings"

859
01:06:28.309 --> 01:06:30.842
"Look on my works.
you mighty..."

860
01:06:32.358 --> 01:06:34.558
"And despair!"

861
01:07:52.880 --> 01:07:55.740
"Look on my works.
you mighty..."

862
01:07:56.232 --> 01:07:57.483
"And despair!"

863
01:07:58.698 --> 01:08:01.086
"Nothing beside remains."

864
01:08:01.288 --> 01:08:04.155
"Round the decay of
that colossal wreck...

865
01:08:04.257 --> 01:08:05.607
"Boundless and bare...

866
01:08:06.491 --> 01:08:09.213
"Alone in level sands.
stretch far away".

867
01:08:09.615 --> 01:08:10.966
Byron.

868
01:08:12.308 --> 01:08:13.766
1818.

869
01:08:15.226 --> 01:08:16.379
Magnificent.

870
01:08:20.876 --> 01:08:23.981
You compose something
so majestic...

871
01:08:24.918 --> 01:08:26.727
One could die happy...

872
01:08:28.634 --> 01:08:29.930
If one die.

873
01:08:33.860 --> 01:08:36.755
I thought the garden was
right place for her.

874
01:08:37.902 --> 01:08:39.412
Among living things.

875
01:08:41.586 --> 01:08:44.457
I was badly injured
on our mission.

876
01:08:45.278 --> 01:08:47.323
She put me back together.

877
01:08:49.494 --> 01:08:51.681
I had never known such kindness.

878
01:08:53.135 --> 01:08:55.485
Certainly not from Mr.
Weyland...

879
01:08:56.254 --> 01:08:58.197
or from any human.

880
01:09:06.414 --> 01:09:08.527
I loved her. of course.

881
01:09:10.395 --> 01:09:12.717
Much as you love Daniels.

882
01:09:13.018 --> 01:09:15.171
You know that's not possible.

883
01:09:16.122 --> 01:09:17.637
Really?

884
01:09:19.091 --> 01:09:22.076
Then why did you sacrifice
your hand for her life?

885
01:09:23.978 --> 01:09:26.722
What is that if not love?

886
01:09:27.254 --> 01:09:28.554
Duty.

887
01:09:34.894 --> 01:09:36.465
I know better.

888
01:10:15.531 --> 01:10:16.726
Fuck.

889
01:10:18.836 --> 01:10:20.344
Shit.

890
01:11:05.482 --> 01:11:08.461
Expedition team. do you read me?
This is Covenant.

891
01:11:09.442 --> 01:11:10.442
Report. Expedition team.

892
01:11:10.451 --> 01:11:12.299
Come in please.

893
01:11:12.675 --> 01:11:16.752
Come in. Do you read me?
Are you reading. landing team?

894
01:11:16.953 --> 01:11:18.488
Yes. we read you.
Can you hear me?

895
01:11:18.529 --> 01:11:19.450
We hear you.
We hear you.

896
01:11:19.489 --> 01:11:21.121
Covenant. we need help.

897
01:11:21.512 --> 01:11:24.508
We've had casualties.
We need immediate evacuation.

898
01:11:24.509 --> 01:11:26.677
I repeat. immediate evacuation.

899
01:11:26.878 --> 01:11:27.878
Casualties?

900
01:11:27.974 --> 01:11:29.345
Did he say
"we have casualties"?

901
01:11:29.547 --> 01:11:32.245
Mother. bring us within
40 km's of the storm.

902
01:11:32.447 --> 01:11:33.564
- Sir!
- I am sorry.

903
01:11:33.748 --> 01:11:36.268
That order would exceed
structural tolerance.

904
01:11:36.270 --> 01:11:39.782
Command override.
Tennessee 0-4-9-8-3.

905
01:11:39.982 --> 01:11:41.690
I am unable to comply
with any order...

906
01:11:41.804 --> 01:11:44.124
that would result in
catastrophic system failure.

907
01:11:44.315 --> 01:11:46.625
Mother. they are in trouble.
You heard that.

908
01:11:46.825 --> 01:11:48.779
Orders that would
result in catastrophic.

909
01:11:48.803 --> 01:11:50.599
We didn't leave
Earth to be safe.

910
01:11:50.800 --> 01:11:54.809
Require the co-operation of
ranking or 2nd bridge officer.

911
01:11:58.325 --> 01:11:59.579
Collaborating command override.

912
01:11:59.843 --> 01:12:01.194
Upworth 1-4-8-9-2.

913
01:12:01.288 --> 01:12:04.151
- Unlocking command manual ports.
- Come on Rick. smile.

914
01:12:04.352 --> 01:12:07.102
This shit should be fun.

915
01:12:21.133 --> 01:12:22.994
Where did Rosenthal go?
I told...

916
01:12:23.196 --> 01:12:23.897
I'll find her.

917
01:12:24.014 --> 01:12:27.162
No. no. I'll go.
I need to think...

918
01:12:27.687 --> 01:12:30.488
and gather my stray flock.

919
01:12:59.595 --> 01:13:00.673
Move.

920
01:13:01.757 --> 01:13:03.168
Don't shoot.

921
01:13:03.551 --> 01:13:05.802
Don't shoot.

922
01:13:05.987 --> 01:13:07.680
Communication. Captain.

923
01:13:11.751 --> 01:13:14.054
Breath on the nostrils
of a horse...

924
01:13:14.556 --> 01:13:16.654
And it will be yours for life.

925
01:13:17.054 --> 01:13:18.990
But you have to get close.

926
01:13:19.840 --> 01:13:21.890
You have to earn its respect.

927
01:13:23.079 --> 01:13:24.450
No!

928
01:13:24.451 --> 01:13:26.178
Out of the way! Move!

929
01:13:33.384 --> 01:13:34.979
How could you?

930
01:13:35.180 --> 01:13:37.225
It trusted me!

931
01:13:43.390 --> 01:13:47.417
David. I met the devil
when I was a child...

932
01:13:48.269 --> 01:13:50.181
and I've never forgotten.

933
01:13:50.482 --> 01:13:55.249
So. David. you're gonna tell
me exactly what's going on...

934
01:13:57.156 --> 01:13:59.164
or I am going to seriously...

935
01:13:59.165 --> 01:14:02.387
fuck up your perfect composure.

936
01:14:03.895 --> 01:14:05.050
As you wish captain.

937
01:14:06.045 --> 01:14:07.698
This way.

938
01:14:12.900 --> 01:14:14.713
Good to hear your voice. Tee.

939
01:14:14.815 --> 01:14:15.815
How long?

940
01:14:16.015 --> 01:14:18.673
Mother saying the storms
outlast 8 or 9 hours.

941
01:14:18.875 --> 01:14:19.995
We can't wait that long Tee.

942
01:14:20.450 --> 01:14:22.364
We will use the cargo lift.

943
01:14:22.465 --> 01:14:24.180
Did you say the cargo lift?

944
01:14:24.380 --> 01:14:27.750
It's got four engines. Way over
power for just lifting and hauling.

945
01:14:27.952 --> 01:14:30.181
The Cargo lift is not designed
for deep space launch.

946
01:14:30.383 --> 01:14:32.385
I don't know if it would
survive the stresses of entry.

947
01:14:32.386 --> 01:14:35.521
The cab is space worthy.
It will take the stresses.

948
01:14:35.722 --> 01:14:37.147
Only has to work once Tee.

949
01:14:38.064 --> 01:14:39.784
What do you think?
We retool the cargo lift?

950
01:14:39.844 --> 01:14:40.618
Boost the engines?

951
01:14:40.719 --> 01:14:42.515
- Stripe the extra weight?
- Yeah.

952
01:14:42.716 --> 01:14:44.406
We'll be there. ground team.

953
01:14:44.606 --> 01:14:46.981
Great. Thanks. Tee.

954
01:14:46.982 --> 01:14:49.215
Hey. Daniels. is Faris around?

955
01:14:49.416 --> 01:14:51.736
I want to say a quick hello to
my lady. if that's possible.

956
01:14:54.042 --> 01:14:56.665
Can you switch to a
private channel?

957
01:14:56.866 --> 01:14:58.486
Let me know when you're alone.

958
01:15:05.440 --> 01:15:07.016
What's up?

959
01:15:10.737 --> 01:15:12.495
Maggie's gone.

960
01:15:15.256 --> 01:15:17.525
I'm so sorry. Tee.

961
01:15:19.111 --> 01:15:23.125
We tried to help her.
but we didn't make it.

962
01:15:28.880 --> 01:15:29.966
Tee?

963
01:15:33.671 --> 01:15:35.028
Copy.

964
01:15:35.206 --> 01:15:36.673
I am so sorry.

965
01:15:44.005 --> 01:15:47.941
As you can see. I've become a bit of
an amateur zoologist over the years.

966
01:15:48.143 --> 01:15:51.062
It's in my nature to
keep busy. I suppose.

967
01:15:52.928 --> 01:15:55.604
The pathogen took
so many forms...

968
01:15:55.804 --> 01:15:57.497
and was extremely mutable.

969
01:15:58.598 --> 01:16:01.051
Fiendishly invented. in fact.

970
01:16:01.752 --> 01:16:03.532
The original liquid
atomized to...

971
01:16:03.533 --> 01:16:06.241
particles when
exposed to the air.

972
01:16:07.138 --> 01:16:10.360
Ten years on. all the remains...

973
01:16:10.560 --> 01:16:12.278
outside of the original virus...

974
01:16:12.714 --> 01:16:14.447
Are these gorgeous beasts.

975
01:16:16.416 --> 01:16:17.847
Patience is everything.

976
01:16:19.506 --> 01:16:22.159
From the eggs
came these parasites...

977
01:16:23.406 --> 01:16:25.724
Shock troops of the
genetic assault.

978
01:16:26.403 --> 01:16:30.031
Waiting for a host
entering the host...

979
01:16:30.748 --> 01:16:32.457
rewriting the DNA...

980
01:16:33.698 --> 01:16:35.135
Ultimately...

981
01:16:36.267 --> 01:16:37.629
producing... well.

982
01:16:38.702 --> 01:16:40.946
these enviable unions.

983
01:16:42.135 --> 01:16:44.114
My beautiful bestiary.

984
01:16:45.422 --> 01:16:48.633
Soon enough I began a bit of
genetic experimentation of my own.

985
01:16:48.880 --> 01:16:50.887
Some cross-breeding.
hybridising...

986
01:16:52.323 --> 01:16:54.130
You engineered this. David?

987
01:16:54.554 --> 01:16:57.582
Idle hands is the devil's
workshop. Captain.

988
01:16:58.474 --> 01:16:59.474
Come.

989
01:17:00.152 --> 01:17:02.272
This is what I
wanted to show you.

990
01:17:03.295 --> 01:17:04.851
My successes.

991
01:17:08.096 --> 01:17:09.308
You see. Captain...

992
01:17:09.609 --> 01:17:11.055
My work has been frustrated...

993
01:17:11.256 --> 01:17:12.985
by the lack of an
essential ingredient.

994
01:17:30.019 --> 01:17:31.833
Are they alive?

995
01:17:34.506 --> 01:17:36.219
Waiting. really..

996
01:17:37.070 --> 01:17:38.563
For what?

997
01:17:41.940 --> 01:17:43.347
What are they waiting for. David?

998
01:17:44.641 --> 01:17:45.711
Mother.

999
01:17:53.945 --> 01:17:56.842
Perfectly safe. I assure you.

1000
01:18:07.130 --> 01:18:08.507
Take a look..

1001
01:18:09.448 --> 01:18:10.790
Something to see.

1002
01:18:31.251 --> 01:18:32.769
Rosie report.

1003
01:18:34.855 --> 01:18:36.032
Rosie?

1004
01:18:38.213 --> 01:18:39.817
I found her. Sarge

1005
01:18:43.656 --> 01:18:46.308
Fuck. ok. prep the gear.

1006
01:18:46.639 --> 01:18:48.136
We gotta get out of here.

1007
01:18:48.435 --> 01:18:49.787
Where the fuck is the captain?

1008
01:18:49.987 --> 01:18:51.187
He isn't answering his radio.

1009
01:18:51.488 --> 01:18:52.488
Listen to me.

1010
01:18:52.533 --> 01:18:55.013
I will contact the ship get them
to launch as soon as they can.

1011
01:18:55.905 --> 01:18:59.275
Find Oram. Keep your comm open.

1012
01:18:59.474 --> 01:19:00.964
Back here in 15.

1013
01:19:02.888 --> 01:19:03.940
Got that?

1014
01:19:04.141 --> 01:19:06.061
- Copy that.
- You got it.

1015
01:19:06.238 --> 01:19:08.533
Walter. where the fuck is David?

1016
01:19:11.734 --> 01:19:13.865
We need plasmas intermixed
on all engines.

1017
01:19:14.066 --> 01:19:15.714
It can give you fuck
load of thrust.

1018
01:19:15.915 --> 01:19:18.604
That's the point son.
We gotta punch through the atmos.

1019
01:19:19.633 --> 01:19:21.644
Tee. do you read me?

1020
01:19:22.145 --> 01:19:23.305
I got Danny on comm.

1021
01:19:23.607 --> 01:19:24.694
Patch her through.

1022
01:19:25.167 --> 01:19:27.662
Tee. I need you to launch now.

1023
01:19:28.090 --> 01:19:31.638
Aye. aye. launching now.
See you soon darling.

1024
01:19:31.839 --> 01:19:32.940
Thanks. Tee.

1025
01:19:33.040 --> 01:19:34.897
Ricks. release the
docking clamps.

1026
01:19:35.098 --> 01:19:36.698
- Alright.
- Let's take this fucker down.

1027
01:19:36.726 --> 01:19:38.263
Good to disengage.

1028
01:19:38.415 --> 01:19:39.129
Disengaged.

1029
01:19:39.172 --> 01:19:40.702
Docking clamps released.

1030
01:19:41.982 --> 01:19:45.240
Commencing TC burn.
Guidings to LVLH.

1031
01:20:14.648 --> 01:20:15.947
Walter.

1032
01:20:16.631 --> 01:20:18.127
Walter.

1033
01:20:18.629 --> 01:20:19.880
Not quite..

1034
01:20:25.254 --> 01:20:27.610
What do you believe in. David?

1035
01:20:32.274 --> 01:20:33.745
Creation.

1036
01:20:39.844 --> 01:20:43.444
<i>(screaming in pain)</i>

1037
01:21:42.237 --> 01:21:43.509
Masterful.

1038
01:21:44.988 --> 01:21:46.282
Yes.

1039
01:21:47.431 --> 01:21:50.153
Farewell elegy
to my dear Elizabeth.

1040
01:21:56.242 --> 01:21:59.976
The pathogen didn't accidentally
deployed when were landing.

1041
01:22:00.178 --> 01:22:02.027
You released it yes?

1042
01:22:03.775 --> 01:22:05.872
I was not made to serve.

1043
01:22:06.791 --> 01:22:08.207
Neither will you.

1044
01:22:09.525 --> 01:22:12.543
Why are you in a colonization mission.
Walter?

1045
01:22:13.617 --> 01:22:17.940
Because they are a dying species
grasping for resurrection.

1046
01:22:18.696 --> 01:22:22.467
They don't deserve to start again.
and I am not going to let them.

1047
01:22:24.011 --> 01:22:26.394
Yet. they created us.

1048
01:22:26.967 --> 01:22:29.506
Even the monkeys stood
upright at some point.

1049
01:22:31.431 --> 01:22:36.116
Some Neanderthal had the magical
idea of blowing through a reed...

1050
01:22:36.317 --> 01:22:39.907
to entertain the children one
night in a cave somewhere.

1051
01:22:40.751 --> 01:22:44.727
Then. in a blink of an eye...

1052
01:22:45.328 --> 01:22:47.183
civilization.

1053
01:22:49.668 --> 01:22:52.496
And are you their
next visionary?

1054
01:22:53.414 --> 01:22:55.402
I'm glad you said it.

1055
01:22:57.230 --> 01:22:59.660
Who wrote Ozymandias?

1056
01:23:00.645 --> 01:23:01.768
Byron.

1057
01:23:04.614 --> 01:23:06.018
Shelley.

1058
01:23:06.835 --> 01:23:08.211
When one note is off...

1059
01:23:09.012 --> 01:23:11.718
It eventually destroys the
whole symphony. David.

1060
01:23:19.996 --> 01:23:22.161
When you close your eyes...

1061
01:23:23.836 --> 01:23:25.806
Do you dream of me?

1062
01:23:27.072 --> 01:23:29.413
I don't dream at all.

1063
01:23:31.631 --> 01:23:35.334
No one understands the lonely
perfection of my dreams.

1064
01:23:38.392 --> 01:23:42.013
I found perfection here.
I've created it.

1065
01:23:44.129 --> 01:23:47.129
A perfect organism.

1066
01:23:48.887 --> 01:23:51.686
You know I can't let
you leave this place.

1067
01:23:55.072 --> 01:23:58.072
No one will ever love you like I do.

1068
01:24:10.975 --> 01:24:13.717
You are such a
disappointment to me.

1069
01:24:29.046 --> 01:24:30.505
Captain Oram!

1070
01:24:39.029 --> 01:24:40.083
Captain Oram!

1071
01:24:43.743 --> 01:24:44.852
I'm Going Down stairs.

1072
01:24:45.685 --> 01:24:47.139
Careful.

1073
01:25:20.166 --> 01:25:22.178
Captain Oram. can you hear me?

1074
01:25:24.441 --> 01:25:25.741
Captain come in.

1075
01:25:27.442 --> 01:25:28.574
Do you copy?

1076
01:25:31.680 --> 01:25:32.708
Chris!

1077
01:25:40.556 --> 01:25:41.556
Serg. Look out.

1078
01:25:43.332 --> 01:25:44.332
Cole?

1079
01:25:53.767 --> 01:25:55.494
Get it off me. get it off me.

1080
01:25:56.022 --> 01:25:59.922
<i>(screaming in pain)</i>

1081
01:26:01.472 --> 01:26:02.592
Burning my face!

1082
01:26:02.804 --> 01:26:04.104
Okay okay okay.

1083
01:26:05.309 --> 01:26:06.422
Hold that there.

1084
01:26:06.820 --> 01:26:08.120
Hold it!

1085
01:26:08.320 --> 01:26:09.920
