1086
01:26:11.563 --> 01:26:12.711
Oh Shit!

1087
01:26:15.314 --> 01:26:16.314
Run!

1088
01:26:28.412 --> 01:26:30.653
Quite the little busy body.

1089
01:26:30.854 --> 01:26:32.817
Remind me.
What is that about...

1090
01:26:33.908 --> 01:26:35.501
curiosity and the cat?

1091
01:26:38.156 --> 01:26:40.563
Shaw didn't die in the crash.

1092
01:26:40.664 --> 01:26:42.065
No.

1093
01:26:42.265 --> 01:26:44.036
What did you do to her?

1094
01:26:44.537 --> 01:26:47.452
Exactly what I am
going to do to you.

1095
01:26:57.739 --> 01:26:58.799
That's the spirit.

1096
01:27:07.328 --> 01:27:10.373
I can see why Walter
thought so much of you.

1097
01:27:10.996 --> 01:27:12.962
Alas he's left this vale of tears.

1098
01:27:27.586 --> 01:27:28.988
Is that how it's done?

1099
