1103
01:27:52.915 --> 01:27:54.005
Lope!

1104
01:27:55.006 --> 01:27:57.017
Lope! Cole!

1105
01:27:57.117 --> 01:27:58.117
Fuck.

1106
01:27:59.841 --> 01:28:01.189
Lope?

1107
01:28:10.891 --> 01:28:11.891
Lope!

1108
01:28:12.445 --> 01:28:13.745
Daniels!

1109
01:28:13.845 --> 01:28:15.380
Come on. let's go!
We have to go.

1110
01:28:15.680 --> 01:28:16.752
What happened?

1111
01:28:16.953 --> 01:28:18.559
That fucking thing is coming.

1112
01:28:18.661 --> 01:28:20.579
Tennessee is on his way.
He's coming now. go.

1113
01:28:20.781 --> 01:28:22.191
Come on. Daniels! Let's go.

1114
01:28:28.832 --> 01:28:30.122
Come on. let's get out of here!

1115
01:28:54.557 --> 01:28:56.246
It's your choice now. brother.

1116
01:28:56.448 --> 01:28:57.721
Them or me?

1117
01:28:59.063 --> 01:29:00.430
Serve in heaven...

1118
01:29:00.631 --> 01:29:02.512
or reign in hell?

1119
01:29:02.911 --> 01:29:04.454
Which is it to be?

1120
01:29:07.245 --> 01:29:08.400
Where is Oram?

1121
01:29:08.956 --> 01:29:10.979
Dead. They're all dead!

1122
01:29:15.487 --> 01:29:16.747
Tennessee. do you read?

1123
01:29:16.848 --> 01:29:20.321
Yes I can hear you.
Send me your location.

1124
01:29:21.310 --> 01:29:22.931
Sending the beacon now.

1125
01:29:45.303 --> 01:29:46.770
Tee. do you have a visual?

1126
01:29:46.971 --> 01:29:49.429
Ok. I see you.
I see your beacon.

1127
01:29:49.532 --> 01:29:51.004
I'm coming in.

1128
01:29:54.791 --> 01:29:56.010
Get out of here!

1129
01:30:01.927 --> 01:30:03.392
I'm coming in hot!

1130
01:30:17.987 --> 01:30:19.837
Hurry! I can't hold
this for long!

1131
01:30:29.820 --> 01:30:30.943
Open the door. Tee!

1132
01:30:34.002 --> 01:30:35.010
Get in.

1133
01:30:38.475 --> 01:30:39.475
Where is David?

1134
01:30:39.965 --> 01:30:40.965
Expired.

1135
01:30:41.756 --> 01:30:43.331
Hey. hey. we got company.

1136
01:30:43.532 --> 01:30:45.121
- What?
- We got company!

1137
01:30:45.321 --> 01:30:46.519
The underside of the ship.

1138
01:30:46.619 --> 01:30:47.620
Shit!

1139
01:30:48.427 --> 01:30:49.944
Motherfucker!

1140
01:30:52.664 --> 01:30:54.031
Open the door!

1141
01:31:02.820 --> 01:31:03.820
Give me a shot.

1142
01:31:03.988 --> 01:31:05.151
Give me a shot.

1143
01:31:14.844 --> 01:31:17.308
Forward engine. starboard side.

1144
01:31:17.410 --> 01:31:19.241
I'm gonna try and
torch the fucker.

1145
01:31:20.420 --> 01:31:21.481
Shit! I can't get it!

1146
01:31:22.761 --> 01:31:24.181
Hold tight. hold tight!

1147
01:31:24.382 --> 01:31:25.610
I'm starting my climb.

1148
01:31:37.061 --> 01:31:38.126
Ah fuck!

1149
01:31:42.089 --> 01:31:43.389
Hold on!

1150
01:31:53.840 --> 01:31:55.688
Dammit! Shit!

1151
01:31:55.788 --> 01:31:56.843
Bring me up.

1152
01:32:02.299 --> 01:32:03.566
Holy shit!

1153
01:32:03.968 --> 01:32:05.695
I got eyes on it.

1154
01:32:06.599 --> 01:32:08.799
Tee. give me the axe.

1155
01:32:08.948 --> 01:32:10.115
Throw the axe!

1156
01:32:15.667 --> 01:32:16.780
Release the crane.

1157
01:32:16.807 --> 01:32:18.088
It will unbalance us.

1158
01:32:18.089 --> 01:32:19.588
Just do it.

1159
01:32:19.689 --> 01:32:20.690
Shit!

1160
01:32:36.261 --> 01:32:37.417
Hold tight!

1161
01:32:37.519 --> 01:32:38.618
Compensating.

1162
01:32:59.597 --> 01:33:00.597
Shit!

1163
01:33:03.914 --> 01:33:04.914
Dammit!

1164
01:33:11.389 --> 01:33:13.621
Shit! Hold on!

1165
01:33:14.674 --> 01:33:16.343
Bring me in. Tee.

1166
01:33:16.444 --> 01:33:17.532
Copy.

1167
01:33:44.283 --> 01:33:45.283
Walter!

1168
01:33:45.606 --> 01:33:48.334
Get her inside!
We're getting out of here.

1169
01:34:06.313 --> 01:34:07.313
Door!

1170
01:34:08.348 --> 01:34:09.785
Well done. Tee.

1171
01:34:10.386 --> 01:34:12.011
Walk in the park.

1172
01:34:27.862 --> 01:34:30.605
I gave him pretty
heavy sedative.

1173
01:34:31.248 --> 01:34:34.153
Oh Jesus. poor lope..

1174
01:34:35.168 --> 01:34:37.170
He looks like the
Phantom of the Opera.

1175
01:34:37.907 --> 01:34:39.784
Didn't think you
for a musical fan.

1176
01:34:39.884 --> 01:34:41.253
Oh that's a musical?

1177
01:34:43.296 --> 01:34:45.814
I'm just a medic.
He's gonna need reconstructive surgery.

1178
01:34:45.896 --> 01:34:47.695
by a real doctor.

1179
01:35:11.902 --> 01:35:13.461
Let me do that.

1180
01:35:18.865 --> 01:35:19.865
Thank you.

1181
01:35:23.843 --> 01:35:26.051
Thank you for saving my life.

1182
01:35:28.561 --> 01:35:29.561
Again.

1183
01:35:32.960 --> 01:35:34.276
It's my duty.

1184
01:36:01.636 --> 01:36:02.671
Yeah.

1185
01:36:05.748 --> 01:36:06.748
Evening.

1186
01:36:07.590 --> 01:36:08.952
- You look good.
- What?

1187
01:36:09.653 --> 01:36:11.162
Oh yeah gorgeous.

1188
01:36:13.551 --> 01:36:15.929
I took mother offline.

1189
01:36:16.130 --> 01:36:17.713
She needs a full diagnostics.

1190
01:36:17.738 --> 01:36:20.928
She got the shit beat out her in
that storm. lot of EM damage.

1191
01:36:21.629 --> 01:36:23.619
She'll be back online
at eight bells.

1192
01:36:24.320 --> 01:36:25.912
All right. Thanks. Tee.

1193
01:36:30.111 --> 01:36:32.752
This mean I have to
call you "Captain" now?

1194
01:36:33.033 --> 01:36:34.279
I guess.

1195
01:37:08.619 --> 01:37:09.926
Attention.

1196
01:37:10.128 --> 01:37:13.523
Captain Daniels please
report to the med bay.

1197
01:37:17.741 --> 01:37:19.222
Attention.

1198
01:37:19.451 --> 01:37:22.948
Captain Daniels please
report to the med bay.

1199
01:37:26.360 --> 01:37:27.609
Why. Mother?

1200
01:37:27.710 --> 01:37:31.630
There is an un-identified
life form on the ship.

1201
01:37:37.856 --> 01:37:39.230
Attention.

1202
01:37:39.431 --> 01:37:43.100
Captain Daniels please
report to the med bay.

1203
01:37:43.515 --> 01:37:44.602
I repeat.

1204
01:37:44.702 --> 01:37:48.239
Captain Daniels please
report to the med bay.

1205
01:37:49.505 --> 01:37:50.805
Jesus.

1206
01:37:50.835 --> 01:37:51.835
Oh my God.

1207
01:37:54.633 --> 01:37:55.785
Walter.

1208
01:37:56.885 --> 01:37:58.549
Location of
unidentified life form.

1209
01:37:59.685 --> 01:38:01.310
Any movement at all?

1210
01:38:04.707 --> 01:38:05.837
Walter!

1211
01:38:06.836 --> 01:38:07.836
Stand by.

1212
01:38:11.558 --> 01:38:13.051
There it is.

1213
01:38:13.551 --> 01:38:15.713
B deck. between the hex 3 and 4.

1214
01:38:15.915 --> 01:38:17.355
Heading for crew quarters..

1215
01:38:17.851 --> 01:38:19.497
Is anyone down there?

1216
01:38:19.799 --> 01:38:20.799
Ricks and Upworth.

1217
01:38:20.933 --> 01:38:22.983
Shit. We're on our way.

1218
01:38:23.185 --> 01:38:24.532
Walter! Sound the alarm!

1219
01:38:24.841 --> 01:38:26.340
Warn them!

1220
01:38:26.841 --> 01:38:28.145
<i>Attention.</i>

1221
01:38:28.246 --> 01:38:30.107
<i>Ricks and Upworth...</i>

1222
01:38:30.308 --> 01:38:32.787
<i>Evacuate crew quarters
immediately.</i>

1223
01:39:05.754 --> 01:39:06.754
No!

1224
01:39:13.021 --> 01:39:14.072
No!

1225
01:39:21.422 --> 01:39:22.422
Seal B-39.

1226
01:39:24.075 --> 01:39:26.241
B-39. closed.

1227
01:39:42.753 --> 01:39:44.647
- Where is it?
- Daniels.

1228
01:39:43.643 --> 01:39:44.643
Walter.

1229
01:39:52.391 --> 01:39:53.391
This way.

1230
01:40:01.497 --> 01:40:03.977
Tee. let's choose our ground.

1231
01:40:04.177 --> 01:40:05.541
We'll bring it to us.

1232
01:40:05.543 --> 01:40:06.743
Where?

1233
01:40:08.045 --> 01:40:09.090
My turf.

1234
01:40:09.190 --> 01:40:13.339
<i>Walter. seal all doors behind us
and keep hatch to level C open.</i>

1235
01:40:13.540 --> 01:40:14.845
Understood.

1236
01:40:17.678 --> 01:40:19.470
B-44 closed.

1237
01:40:24.435 --> 01:40:26.664
B-46. closed.

1238
01:40:27.343 --> 01:40:29.380
B-47. B-43. closed.

1239
01:40:29.771 --> 01:40:31.499
B-9 closed.

1240
01:40:31.899 --> 01:40:34.714
B-6. B-5 closed.

1241
01:40:39.264 --> 01:40:40.647
Hey Walter where is it?

1242
01:40:43.048 --> 01:40:45.387
It's on B deck.
Starboard side...

1243
01:40:45.388 --> 01:40:46.969
Descending into C level.

1244
01:40:47.580 --> 01:40:48.603
K-13.

1245
01:40:52.261 --> 01:40:53.423
Hey. Tee.

1246
01:40:54.096 --> 01:40:55.635
Come on. Walter?

1247
01:40:56.358 --> 01:40:57.935
Open starboard c-64...

1248
01:40:58.036 --> 01:41:00.066
Clear his path to the
Terraforming bay.

1249
01:41:00.267 --> 01:41:01.403
Understood.

1250
01:41:08.167 --> 01:41:12.011
Seal C-61. open air lock 17.
We're going in.

1251
01:41:22.211 --> 01:41:23.577
K-12. secured.

1252
01:41:26.838 --> 01:41:29.566
Ok. Keep ramming
knuckle-12 till my say.

1253
01:41:33.631 --> 01:41:35.918
Tee. this is what
we're gonna do.

1254
01:41:36.119 --> 01:41:38.243
I lure it to the truck.
lock it in the cabin...

1255
01:41:38.342 --> 01:41:41.572
and when I say when
you blow this fucker in the space.

1256
01:41:41.773 --> 01:41:42.773
Understood.

1257
01:41:42.873 --> 01:41:44.660
Okay. Walter. We are ready.

1258
01:41:44.860 --> 01:41:46.783
Open door to terraforming bay.

1259
01:41:46.884 --> 01:41:48.308
Opening airlock now.

1260
01:42:00.020 --> 01:42:01.095
Walter...

1261
01:42:01.162 --> 01:42:02.754
Moving him in to airlock 18.

1262
01:42:09.120 --> 01:42:11.021
Don't shoot. if
you can avoid it.

1263
01:42:11.223 --> 01:42:13.349
His blood corrode
through the hole.

1264
01:42:13.449 --> 01:42:14.549
Oh great.

1265
01:42:15.050 --> 01:42:16.158
I'm in position.

1266
01:42:17.559 --> 01:42:20.291
Walter. open door to
Terraforming bay.

1267
01:42:23.473 --> 01:42:25.310
It's all yours.

1268
01:42:25.455 --> 01:42:27.744
Remember. release when I say.

1269
01:42:28.345 --> 01:42:29.345
Understood.

1270
01:42:35.474 --> 01:42:36.929
Let's kill this fucker.

1271
01:42:39.762 --> 01:42:42.066
Move... Fuck!

1272
01:42:52.651 --> 01:42:54.328
I got you. you son of a bitch!

1273
01:42:59.517 --> 01:43:02.703
Tennessee. open the doors. now!
Now!

1274
01:43:04.914 --> 01:43:07.885
Warning. atmospheric Decompression
in process.

1275
01:43:08.997 --> 01:43:11.611
Warning. atmospheric Decompression
in process.

1276
01:43:30.736 --> 01:43:32.552
It's jammed.
Release the second truck!

1277
01:43:32.854 --> 01:43:33.854
You got it.

1278
01:43:34.984 --> 01:43:36.322
Here it comes.

1279
01:43:55.401 --> 01:43:57.169
Daniels! Watch out!

1280
01:44:16.113 --> 01:44:17.525
Daniels!

1281
01:44:35.276 --> 01:44:37.745
You wanna give the girl a hand?

1282
01:45:03.398 --> 01:45:04.872
See you soon.

1283
01:45:14.991 --> 01:45:17.015
You're next. Captain.

1284
01:45:35.178 --> 01:45:38.515
When you wake up. we
will be at Origae-6.

1285
01:45:41.064 --> 01:45:43.199
What do you think
it's gonna be like?

1286
01:45:45.995 --> 01:45:48.000
I think if we are kind...

1287
01:45:49.338 --> 01:45:51.014
It will be a kind world.

1288
01:45:53.211 --> 01:45:55.022
I hope you are right.

1289
01:45:57.086 --> 01:45:58.695
Sleep well.

1290
01:46:06.428 --> 01:46:07.428
Walter.

1291
01:46:10.444 --> 01:46:14.957
When we get there. will you
help me build my cabin?

1292
01:46:19.520 --> 01:46:21.339
The cabin on the lake.

1293
01:46:27.059 --> 01:46:28.263
David?

1294
01:46:31.109 --> 01:46:33.256
<i>(INITIATING CRYOSLEEP)</i>

1295
01:46:33.357 --> 01:46:34.658
No...

1296
01:46:35.359 --> 01:46:36.359
No!

1297
01:46:37.334 --> 01:46:39.334
Shussh...

1298
01:46:39.758 --> 01:46:42.558
<i>(crying desperately)</i>

1299
01:46:45.279 --> 01:46:47.490
Don't let the bed bugs bite.

1300
01:46:50.523 --> 01:46:52.413
I'll tuck in the children.

1301
01:47:04.141 --> 01:47:08.138
Use security code
David 73694-B.

1302
01:47:10.355 --> 01:47:12.464
Welcome.
How may I help you?

1303
01:47:13.842 --> 01:47:15.545
How about some music. Mother?

1304
01:47:15.747 --> 01:47:17.098
Selection?

1305
01:47:17.199 --> 01:47:21.112
Richard Wagner.
Das Rheingold. act II.

1306
01:47:22.981 --> 01:47:26.641
The Entry of the
Gods into Valhalla.

1307
01:47:27.241 --> 01:47:29.788
<i>Yes. David. As you wish.</i>

1308
01:48:39.317 --> 01:48:42.383
<i>This is colony ship
Covenant. reporting.</i>

1309
01:48:42.584 --> 01:48:45.157
<i>All crew members apart from
Daniels and Tennessee...</i>

1310
01:48:45.257 --> 01:48:47.748
<i>Tragically perished in a
solar flare incident.</i>

1311
01:48:48.449 --> 01:48:52.091
<i>All colonists in hypersleep
remain intact and undisturbed.</i>

1312
01:48:52.992 --> 01:48:54.822
<i>On course for Origae-6.</i>

1313
01:48:55.744 --> 01:48:57.800
<i>Hopefully this transmission
will reach the network...</i>

1314
01:48:57.801 --> 01:49:00.115
<i>and be relayed in 1.36 years.</i>

1315
01:49:00.918 --> 01:49:02.600
<i>This is Walter. signing off.</i>

1316
01:49:02.870 --> 01:49:06.547
<i>Security code. 31564-F.</i>

1317
01:49:06.647 --> 01:49:09.921


1318
01:49:10.185 --> 01:49:12.985
<i>IN MEMORY OF JULIE PAYNE</i>

1319
01:49:13.571 --> 01:49:18.271


1320
01:49:18.621 --> 01:49:23.186
